+## [3.4.3] - 2026-09-03
+
+### Added — a sandbox-checkout helper for probing the UserPromptSubmit hook against a live run
+
+`scripts/compound-v-sandbox-checkout.sh` builds a fresh checkout for exercising `hooks/triage-prompt-nudge.sh` — the UserPromptSubmit hook — against a checkout that carries a live run, without touching the Stop hook path (which needs `.claude/compound-v.json`, absent from any sandbox). Built by a Codex worker on Engine C; no timing or performance metrics are claimed for it.
 
 ### Fixed — an external worker's cap fits inside the harness Bash ceiling, and the wrapper is told to wait (finding 75)
 
